  "slug": "ev-charger-installation-intake-form",
  "title": "EV Charger Installation Intake Form",
  "subtitle": "An original ev charger installation workflow that turns an initial request into a triaged, evidence-backed assignment, with explicit qualified-review, stop-work, escalation, and accountable handoff controls.",
  "description": "A workflow-complete ev charger installation intake form for the electric vehicle charging site that captures exact identity, domain observations, supporting evidence, decisions, exceptions, responsible owners, and closeout without replacing professional judgment or the organization's controlling procedures.",
  "use_case": "Use when a coordinator receives a new request and must verify identity, scope, evidence, hazards, feasibility, and the next accountable handoff before field activity is scheduled. The charging deployment coordinator owns routing, and closure requires documented evidence, disposition of restrictions, and acceptance by the designated reviewer.",
  "risk_tier": "B",
